.TH tictacli 1
.SH NAME
tictacli \- TicTacToe WebSocket client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tictacli
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A terminal TicTacToe client that speaks the WebSocket protocol of the tictacli-server. Supports authenticated accounts, global ranking, real-time spectating, and a reconnection grace period.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-server\fR \fIURL\fR
Server URL to connect to.
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fINAME\fR
Guest name.
.TP
\fB\-\-insecure\fR
Allow insecure connections (e.g. self-signed certificates).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBTICTACTOE_SERVER\fR
Default server URL.
.TP
\fBTICTACTOE_NAME\fR
Default guest name.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI~/.config/tictacli/config.toml\fR
User configuration file.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Launch connection screen:
.B tictacli
.TP
Connect directly:
.B tictacli \-\-server wss://game.example.com \-\-name Bob
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBtictacli-server\fR(1)
